{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where encrypted content plays, where it cannot, and how the SDK decides which it is."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK plays FairPlay-protected HLS through "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer"},{"type":"text","text":" — the thin wrapper around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"AVFoundation that skips the YBVR signaling and geometry stack. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"pipeline behind ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the immersive renderers, has no DRM path at all:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing in it accepts a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmConfig","type":"reference"},{"text":", so a protected stream opened through it fails to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"decrypt.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"That split is not an oversight waiting to be wired up. It follows from how protected frames","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reach the screen, which is covered below, and it decides which content can carry DRM at all."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Where DRM Can Be Used","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Where-DRM-Can-Be-Used"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Playback path","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How frames reach the screen"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protected content"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerLayer"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on visionOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"RealityKit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, on device only"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Metal, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerItemVideoOutput"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VisionSurfaceContext"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Metal, via Compositor Services","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponentSurfaceContext","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityKit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not available — no API to supply a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmConfig","isActive":true}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rule behind the table: FairPlay decodes into a protected path that the system can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composite but the app cannot read. Surfaces that hand the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayer"},{"type":"text","text":" to the system — an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerLayer"},{"type":"text","text":", or a RealityKit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" — therefore play protected content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fine. The YBVR geometry renderers do the opposite: they copy each decoded frame out with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerItemVideoOutput.copyPixelBuffer"},{"type":"text","text":" and draw it onto a sphere, dome, fisheye, flat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"panel, or control-room composition. No frames are handed out for protected content, so there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is nothing to texture the geometry with."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In content terms:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"DRM is possible","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for material that plays as an ordinary AVFoundation item: flat or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rectilinear video, and immersive video whose projection is described by embedded metadata"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system itself understands (APMP, spatial, and the equirectangular kinds AVFoundation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recognises), which "},{"code":"DirectPlayerImmersiveScene","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the visionOS demo app projects onto a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"DRM is not possible","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for anything that depends on YBVR-side rendering: custom geometry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the signaling file, viewport-tiled streams, multi-camera control rooms, or camera"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switching inside a single stream. Those need the pixel buffers FairPlay withholds."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"DRM is not possible over RTMP.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Low-latency streams play through "},{"code":"LowLatencyPlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which is not AVFoundation-based and has no FairPlay path, so a ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block on an RTMP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream is reported but cannot be honoured."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Configuring DRM","anchor":"Configuring-DRM"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The signaling file identifies the key; the certificate and license endpoints come from the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host app. Both halves are required — a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on its own does not configure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anything."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let player = DirectPlayer()","","player.drmConfig = DrmConfig(","    certificateURL: \"https:\/\/...\/fairplay.cer\",","    licenseURL: \"https:\/\/...\/AcquireLicense\",","    drmKeyManager: keyManager",")","","await player.open(url: streamURL)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/drmConfig","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" before ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/open(url:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Assigning it builds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"DrmManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"type":"text","text":" installs the platform key handler around the new item — on visionOS"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the content key session is created there — so a config assigned afterwards does not apply to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the item already loaded."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the stream follows the convention of a sibling signaling file, the two steps collapse","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into one call that fetches the key material and opens the stream:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["try await player.open(","    url: streamURL,","    fetchingDrmFromSignalingWith: certificateURL,","    licenseURL: licenseURL",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Providers","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Providers"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager\/provider"},{"type":"text","text":" selects the license flow: "},{"code":"\"axinom\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"\"ybvr\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are recognised,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and any other value falls back to Axinom. Both currently resolve to the Axinom provider,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"which mints a license JWT and sends it as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-AxDRM-Message"},{"text":" with the SPC.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That JWT is minted by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmJWTRequest"},{"type":"text","text":" against a hardcoded development XMS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backend, using OAuth client credentials compiled into the SDK. DRM therefore only works"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"today against that one environment, and the credentials ship inside any binary that links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SDK. Treat production DRM as needing this made configurable first."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"text":"How DRM Is Detected","anchor":"How-DRM-Is-Detected","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Detection runs entirely off the signaling file, before playback starts. Nothing inspects the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"media playlist, so an encrypted stream whose signaling omits ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is indistinguishable from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clear content until AVFoundation asks for a key and fails."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/fetchSignalingFile(video:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" resolves the signaling version from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"video URL: a path containing "},{"code":"_signaling_v4.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is v4, any other ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".json"},{"text":" path is v3, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a media URL is v2 — where the signaling file is the same URL with its extension swapped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"for "},{"code":".json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The response is decoded into "},{"code":"Signaling","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (v2), ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV3"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV4"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller asks the result for "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SignalingInterface\/drmKeyManager()"},{"text":". A non-","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" means the content is protected, and both demo apps route it to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on that basis."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content with no "},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key — or with ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"drm\": null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — is simply unprotected. The signaling","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decodes normally, no DRM is reported, and the stream plays through the usual geometry","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pipeline; this is the ordinary case for every clear title.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoding the block requires all three of ","type":"text"},{"code":"ekid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"keyManagerUrl","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"drmProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A block","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that is present but missing any of them is dropped on every signaling version, leaving the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream playable but reported as clear — so genuinely protected content then fails later at key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time with an opaque AVFoundation error rather than a DRM-specific one. Validate the block when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"publishing. v4 logs the dropped block; v2 and v3 discard it silently.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What each version reports today:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Signaling version","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" in the file"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reported by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drmKeyManager()"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v2"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key manager"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v3"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoded"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key manager","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"v4","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key manager"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A signaling model that decodes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" but does not implement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SignalingInterface\/drmKeyManager()"},{"type":"text","text":" inherits the protocol’s default of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"silently reports protected content as clear — nothing fails to compile. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV4"},{"type":"text","text":" did"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly that until its accessor was added, so DRM-protected v4 streams were routed to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"geometry pipeline where they cannot decrypt. Any new signaling version must implement that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requirement, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingDrmTests"},{"type":"text","text":" asserts detection through the protocol rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concrete type to keep the path covered."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Outside the manager, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/fetchDrmKeyManager(forStreamURL:session:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" performs the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same lookup standalone: it swaps the stream URL’s extension for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".json"},{"type":"text","text":", decodes the v2 shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"DirectPlayerDrmError.noDrmInfoInSignaling","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when no "},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry is present.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Platform-Differences","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Platform Differences"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK ships for iOS 17+ and visionOS 26+, and each uses the key-delivery API available to it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Both share the same certificate fetch, license exchange, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmProvider"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" uses the classic ","type":"text"},{"code":"skd:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" resource-loader flow. ","type":"text"},{"code":"ApplePlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sets itself as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asset’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVAssetResourceLoaderDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for every stream, protected or not, and forwards","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key requests to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmManager"},{"type":"text","text":" only when a config was supplied. Without one the request goes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unanswered and playback fails."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" has never supported that flow and uses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVContentKeySession(keySystem: .fairPlayStreaming)"},{"type":"text","text":" with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVContentKeySessionDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The session is built during "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"type":"text","text":" only when a config is present."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"FairPlay needs the Secure Enclave, so it does not work in the visionOS simulator —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constructing the content key session there raises an uncatchable exception. The SDK detects","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the simulator, skips the session, and logs instead of trapping, which means protected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content will load but not decrypt. Verify DRM on a real Vision Pro."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"text":"Failure Modes","anchor":"Failure-Modes","type":"heading","level":2},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symptom"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Protected stream plays black, or stalls at start","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Opened through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"; the geometry pipeline has no DRM path"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content treated as clear despite a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" block"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The block is missing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ekid"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyManagerUrl"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drmProvider"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"License request rejected"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"JWT minting failed; the error is swallowed and an empty "},{"code":"X-AxDRM-Message","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is sent, so the CKC fetch fails"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Works on device, fails in the visionOS simulator","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Expected — FairPlay is unavailable there"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block is detected but never honoured","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The stream is RTMP, played by ","type":"text"},{"code":"LowLatencyPlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which has no FairPlay path","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"FairPlay DRM"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/drm"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/QuickStart","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"],"title":"Related Documentation","anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion"],"title":"Guides","generated":true,"anchor":"Guides"}],"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"YBVR Apple SDK for streaming and displaying VR video on 